3. Terminus (TTF)  (assets/fonts/TerminusTTF.ttf)
================================================================================

The interface font, embedded in the editor binary and therefore redistributed
with it. Bundled unmodified — the SIL Open Font License reserves the names
"Terminus Font" and "Terminus (TTF)" against modified versions, and shipping the
released file exactly as released keeps that question from arising.

    Terminus (TTF) 4.49.3
    Copyright (c) 2010-2020 Dimitar Zhekov (Terminus Font)
    TrueType conversion copyright (c) Tilman Blumenbach
    <https://files.ax86.net/terminus-ttf/>
    Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

The OFL permits bundling the font with software "provided that each copy
contains the above copyright notice and this license... either as stand-alone
text files, human-readable headers or in the appropriate machine-readable
metadata fields". The full licence is in assets/fonts/OFL.txt, is compiled into
the binary alongside the font, and is shown by the editor's info window — that
window is how a binary-only copy satisfies the condition.
